'' 'public redim shared' IS EXPORTED, as 'public dim shared' was: the interface writer took
'' only DIM and STATIC, so an importer's 'A' was TKO0743 (tiko-editor TE-003). A REDIM's bounds
'' are run time, so it is exported as '( any )' and keeps the size the module gave it.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/redimexport/main.tiko -o tests/modules/redimexport.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/redimexport.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1 5 1-1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2 7
